<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="nl">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Welkom op mijn website</title>
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e3c72, #2a5298);
            color: #ffffff;
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .container {
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
            padding: 40px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            max-width: 600px;
            width: 90%;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
        }

        h1 {
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            font-size: 2.2rem;
        }

        h2 {
            font-weight: normal;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            color: #dcdcdc;
        }

        p {
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .info {
            margin-top: 25px;
            text-align: left;
        }

        .info li {
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        footer {
            margin-top: 30px;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: #cccccc;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="container">
        <h1>Welkom op mijn website</h1>
        <h2>Anthony Reyes Castañeda</h2>

        <p>
            Hallo! Welkom op mijn persoonlijke website, gehost in de cloud
            en gedeployed via Docker en GitHub Actions.
        </p>

        <div class="info">
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Leeftijd:</strong> 98 jaar</li>
                <li><strong>Werk:</strong> Dr Depots Antwerpen</li>
                <li><strong>Hobby’s:</strong> Voetballen en boeken lezen</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <footer>
            Cloudsystemen project – 2025
        </footer>
    </div>

</body>
</html>

